       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CSPURGE.
      *****************************************************************
      * CSS HOUSEKEEPING - DELETES CLOSED ZERO-BALANCE CUSTOMERS.    *
      * PREDICATE IS ALL LITERALS, SO NO HOST VARIABLE CARRIES A     *
      * WIDENED VALUE - BUT IT COPIES CSCUST AND MUST BE REBUILT.    *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE CSCUST END-EXEC.
       01  WS-DELETED              PIC S9(7)       COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               DELETE FROM CSS_CUSTOMER
                WHERE CUST_STATUS = 'C'
                  AND CUST_BALANCE = 0
           END-EXEC
           MOVE SQLERRD(3) TO WS-DELETED
           STOP RUN.
